":false,"text":"主人公の世話女房役である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家庭は汎用である。ごくごく平均的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツをこよなく愛する運動系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公はたまに涼香のことをじゃまだと思う節もあるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本心からじゃまだと思ったり目の上のたんこぶと考えるわけではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小うるさいけどしかたがないか、程度である。いわば小姑。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"細々と口うるさい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頼まれても居ないのに弁当を作ってきたりと世話焼くのが好き。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"109927"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7bc389e56373e233d2d77c9a2fbe9ca8bb8dbca8ecf71e217a378daf938864c6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/9359b076f658989cf1d6631ed60c8f9efb5cda72f7da5a182a2d38477c354025.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"友永朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:113316:109927:4432:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c138070","characterName":"鈴木公志","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c138070"},"originalCharacterName":"鈴木公志","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist. He is childhood friend's with Suzuka. He's neither dumb or smart, he's average, generic, and bland. At worst, he can be indecisive and emotional."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is very interested in sex, especially because he's at that age. He's even interested in sex with people he doesn't particularly have any interest in, his desire is so strong he is ready for the act whenever wherever."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceChar